染都正常。\n\n## 维护方式\n\n以后可以直接在 `src/content/life/essays` 下新增 Markdown 文件。\n\n生活页的追番和图片数据分别来自 `src/data/anime.json` 与 `src/data/gallery.json`。","src/content/life/essays/first-note.md","ccd77a57d0324b5a",{"html":26,"metadata":27},"\u003Cp>这个页面用于确认 Life 区的随笔路由、目录和文章渲染都正常。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"维护方式\">维护方式\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>以后可以直接在 \u003Ccode>src/content/life/essays\u003C/code> 下新增 Markdown 文件。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>生活页的追番和图片数据分别来自 \u003Ccode>src/data/anime.json\u003C/code> 与 \u003Ccode>src/data/gallery.json\u003C/code>。\u003C/p>",{"headings":28,"localImagePaths":32,"remoteImagePaths":33,"frontmatter":34,"imagePaths":37},[29],{"depth":30,"slug":31,"text":31},2,"维护方式",[],[],{"title":14,"description":15,"date":35,"tags":36,"draft":20,"mood":21},["Date","2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[18,19],[],"learn",["Map",40,41,64,65,96,97],"01-computer-science",{"id":40,"data":42,"body":49,"filePath":50,"digest":51,"rendered":52},{"title":43,"description":44,"date":45,"tags":46,"draft":20},"Computer Science","计算机科学学习目录，示例展示目录首页和子文章如何共用文件树。",["Date","2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[47,48],"cs","index","这里是一个目录首页。你可以把课程、章节和专题都放进这个文件夹。\n\n如果某个目录没有 `index.md`，站点会自动生成目录列表；如果有 `index.md`，它会像普通文章一样渲染，同时仍然可以在左侧树中展开子节点。\n\n## 文件规则\n\n- 使用英文 `kebab-case`\n- 使用 `01-`、`02-` 控制排序\n- 页面显示时会隐藏数字前缀\n- 图片可以和 `index.md` 放在同一个目录","src/content/learn/01-computer-science/index.md","1df3a15019b3d0aa",{"html":53,"metadata":54},"\u003Cp>这里是一个目录首页。你可以把课程、章节和专题都放进这个文件夹。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>如果某个目录没有 \u003Ccode>index.md\u003C/code>，站点会自动生成目录列表；如果有 \u003Ccode>index.md\u003C/code>，它会像普通文章一样渲染，同时仍然可以在左侧树中展开子节点。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"文件规则\">文件规则\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>使用英文 \u003Ccode>kebab-case\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>使用 \u003Ccode>01-\u003C/code>、\u003Ccode>02-\u003C/code> 控制排序\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>页面显示时会隐藏数字前缀\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>图片可以和 \u003Ccode>index.md\u003C/code> 放在同一个目录\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>",{"headings":55,"localImagePaths":58,"remoteImagePaths":59,"frontmatter":60,"imagePaths":63},[56],{"depth":30,"slug":57,"text":57},"文件规则",[],[],{"title":43,"description":44,"date":61,"tags":62,"draft":20},["Date","2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[47,48],[],"02-labs/01-static-search",{"id":64,"data":66,"body":74,"filePath":75,"digest":76,"rendered":77},{"title":67,"description":68,"date":69,"tags":70,"draft":20},"Static Search Experiment","Pagefind 静态搜索实验记录，展示实验复现卡片的写法。",["Date","2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[71,72,73],"lab","search","pagefind","这个实验用于验证 Astro 静态站在构建后生成 Pagefind 搜索索引。\n\n## Reproduce\n\n```bash\npnpm install\npnpm build\npnpm preview\n```\n\n## Environment\n\n- Framework: Astro\n- Search: Pagefind\n- Output: `dist/pagefind`\n\n## Result\n\n构建完成后，搜索弹窗会从 `/pagefind/pagefind.js` 加载索引。开发模式下如果没有索引，界面会显示提示。","src/content/learn/02-labs/01-static-search/index.md","11aaadc25725bb77",{"html":78,"metadata":79},"\u003Cp>这个实验用于验证 Astro 静态站在构建后生成 Pagefind 搜索索引。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"reproduce\">Reproduce\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"bash\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">pnpm\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> install\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">pnpm\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> build\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">pnpm\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> preview\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"environment\">Environment\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>Framework: Astro\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Search: Pagefind\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>Output: \u003Ccode>dist/pagefind\u003C/code>\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"result\">Result\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>构建完成后，搜索弹窗会从 \u003Ccode>/pagefind/pagefind.js\u003C/code> 加载索引。开发模式下如果没有索引，界面会显示提示。\u003C/p>",{"headings":80,"localImagePaths":90,"remoteImagePaths":91,"frontmatter":92,"imagePaths":95},[81,84,87],{"depth":30,"slug":82,"text":83},"reproduce","Reproduce",{"depth":30,"slug":85,"text":86},"environment","Environment",{"depth":30,"slug":88,"text":89},"result","Result",[],[],{"title":67,"description":68,"date":93,"tags":94,"draft":20},["Date","2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[71,72,73],[],"01-computer-science/01-operating-system/01-process-scheduling",{"id":96,"data":98,"body":105,"filePath":106,"digest":107,"rendered":108},{"title":99,"description":100,"date":101,"tags":102,"draft":20},"Process Scheduling","操作系统进程调度笔记示例，展示长文、代码块、标签和目录。",["Date","2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[103,19,104],"os","scheduler","进程调度负责在可运行任务之间分配 CPU 时间。它连接了吞吐量、响应时间、公平性和系统开销。\n\n## 关键目标\n\n- **响应时间**：交互式任务希望尽快得到反馈。\n- **吞吐量**：批处理任务希望单位时间内完成更多工作。\n- **公平性**：不同进程不应长期饥饿。\n- **开销控制**：上下文切换不能过于频繁。\n\n## 简化模型\n\n下面是一段非常小的伪代码，用来描述轮转调度的形状。\n\n```ts\ntype Task = {\n  id: string;\n  remaining: number;\n};\n\nexport function roundRobin(queue: Task[], quantum: number) {\n  const timeline: string[] = [];\n\n  while (queue.length > 0) {\n    const task = queue.shift()!;\n    const slice = Math.min(task.remaining, quantum);\n    timeline.push(`${task.id}:${slice}`);\n    task.remaining -= slice;\n\n    if (task.remaining > 0) {\n      queue.push(task);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return timeline;\n}\n```\n\n## 复习问题\n\n1. 时间片过大会发生什么？\n2. 时间片过小会带来什么额外成本？\n3. 为什么交互式系统更关心响应时间？","src/content/learn/01-computer-science/01-operating-system/01-process-scheduling/index.md","6e2041d8efe508b4",{"html":109,"metadata":110},"\u003Cp>进程调度负责在可运行任务之间分配 CPU 时间。它连接了吞吐量、响应时间、公平性和系统开销。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"关键目标\">关键目标\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cul>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>响应时间\u003C/strong>：交互式任务希望尽快得到反馈。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>吞吐量\u003C/strong>：批处理任务希望单位时间内完成更多工作。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>公平性\u003C/strong>：不同进程不应长期饥饿。\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>开销控制\u003C/strong>：上下文切换不能过于频繁。\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"简化模型\">简化模型\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>下面是一段非常小的伪代码，用来描述轮转调度的形状。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"ts\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">type\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> Task\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">  id\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> string\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">  remaining\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> number\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">};\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">export\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> function\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> roundRobin\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">queue\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> Task\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[], \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">quantum\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> number\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> timeline\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">:\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> string\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">[] \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> [];\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  while\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (queue.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">length\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> >\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">    const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> task\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> queue.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">shift\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">()\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">!\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">    const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> slice\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> Math.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">min\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(task.remaining, quantum);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    timeline.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">push\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">`${\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">task\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">id\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">}:${\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">slice\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">}`\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    task.remaining \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">-=\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> slice;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">    if\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> (task.remaining \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> 0\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">) {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">      queue.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">push\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(task);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    }\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  }\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">  return\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> timeline;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"复习问题\">复习问题\u003C/h2>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>时间片过大会发生什么？\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>时间片过小会带来什么额外成本？\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>为什么交互式系统更关心响应时间？\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>",{"headings":111,"localImagePaths":118,"remoteImagePaths":119,"frontmatter":120,"imagePaths":123},[112,114,116],{"depth":30,"slug":113,"text":113},"关键目标",{"depth":30,"slug":115,"text":115},"简化模型",{"depth":30,"slug":117,"text":117},"复习问题",[],[],{"title":99,"description":100,"date":121,"tags":122,"draft":20},["Date","2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z"],[103,19,104],[]]